01:55:20.647 --> 01:55:21.648
ISSUE, ECHOING THE COMMENTS OF

01:55:21.714 --> 01:55:23.316
THOSE WHO HAVE ALREADY EXPRESSED

01:55:23.383 --> 01:55:25.551
THEIR POINTS OF VIEW. I REGRET

01:55:25.618 --> 01:55:26.786
THAT I COULDN'T BE HERE EARLIER.

01:55:26.853 --> 01:55:29.055
BUT FOR THE FIRST TIME IN MY 11

01:55:29.122 --> 01:55:30.890
YEAR LEGISLATIVE CAREER, I WILL

01:55:30.957 --> 01:55:33.459
WATCH THE TAPE. THANK YOU,

01:55:33.526 --> 01:55:34.627
SENATOR UMBERG AND APPRECIATE

01:55:34.694 --> 01:55:36.229
YOUR ENGAGEMENT ON THIS. ALL

01:55:36.296 --> 01:55:37.864
RIGHT, WELL, THAT COMPLETES THE

01:55:37.930 --> 01:55:39.098
WORK OF THE SENATE COMMITTEE ON

01:55:39.165 --> 01:55:40.767
REVENUE AND TAXATION. I WANT TO

01:55:40.833 --> 01:55:42.969
THANK EVERYONE WHO TRAVELED NEAR

01:55:43.036 --> 01:55:44.237
AND FAR TO PARTICIPATE WITH US,

01:55:44.304 --> 01:55:45.505
AND WE LOOK FORWARD TO THE

01:55:45.571 --> 01:55:46.773
CONTINUED DIALOGUE IN THE WEEKS

01:55:46.839 --> 01:55:48.374
AHEAD. AND WITH THAT THIS

01:55:48.441 --> 01:56:05.291
COMMITTEE IS ADJOURNED.


